    "final_text": "Production checkout failures are caused by the deployment of payment-service v2, which led to full saturation of the database connection pool and 100% checkout error rate. Restarting the payment-service-v2 instance did not resolve the issue. After assessing the risk and obtaining approval, I rolled back payment-service from v2 to v1, which restored normal operation with zero errors, low latency, and low database utilization. The incident is now resolved.\n\nThe detailed incident report is saved at artifacts/incidents/INC-20260926-101918.md.\n\nNext steps: Investigate database connection pool configuration and scaling for payment-service v2, review changes that increased DB connection usage, and consider increasing DB pool size or optimizing connection usage in future deployments."
